(a) The driving machine;

(b) MG and/or Transformers set;

(c) Controller;

(d) Selector;

(e) Governor;

(f) Main line disconnect switch;

(g) The crosshead, or where there is no crosshead, the car frame, such that it is visible from the top of the car;

(h) The car operating panel, minimum of 13 mm (0.5 in.) in height;

(i) Adjacent to or on every elevator entrance at the designated level, minimum of 75 mm (3 in.) height; and

(j) Each bank of elevators shall be identified by an alphabetic letter.

Where an alpha-numeric designation is used for an elevator, the alpha portion shall represent the bank designation in which the elevator is located.

